  "id": "Lyo.KeyStore.Web.Components",
  "name": "Lyo.KeyStore.Web.Components",
  "area": "Security",
  "tagline": "In-process Blazor workbench for IKeyStore. Lists key ids and versions, adds from a string, rotates, and sets current. No HTTP, no raw key bytes.",
  "description": "In-process Blazor workbench for `IKeyStore`. Hosts inject `IKeyStore` (`LocalKeyStore` or AWS). The UI never calls an API and never displays key material.",
